  "_note": "The single source for Hako's design tokens: Kawase's Senryo system (/Users/abu/dev/hackathon/tamion/DESIGN.md) with Hako's own accent. Edit this file, then `pnpm --filter @hako/brand build` (scripts/build.mjs writes generated/web.css, generated/tokens.ts and the mark assets; scripts/check-contrast.mjs then fails the build when any text pair drops below 4.5:1). Token names follow shadcn's variables plus Senryo's; never edit the generated files.",
